.TH GETRESGID 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
getresgid \- writes the real, effective and saved group ids to three writable pointers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int getresgid(gid_t* real, gid_t* effective, gid_t* saved);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Writes the real, effective and saved group IDs to three writable pointers.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR getresgid (2)
